# Project overview

Bilingual personal portfolio (Guilherme Guain). Next.js 16 **App Router** in `src/app/`, React 19, TypeScript strict, Vanilla Extract, react-i18next (`pt-BR` default, `en` at `/en`).

- Single page: `src/app/[locale]/page.tsx` (ISR 24h). Shell: `Page` → Header, main, Footer.
- Use path aliases (`@components/*`, `@styles/*`, …), not deep relative imports.
- Copy lives in `public/locales/{en,pt-BR}/*.json`. Update **both** locales. Register new namespaces in `src/lib/i18n.ts`.
- Style only with Vanilla Extract (`*.css.ts`) and `vars` from `@styles/theme.css`.
- Do not migrate back to the Pages Router, Tailwind, CSS Modules, or styled-components unless asked.
- No API/auth/DB. No `console.log` (ESLint `no-console`).
- GTM id `GTM-MFKHPQ4`. Existing dataLayer events: `contactClick`, `menuClick`.
- Prettier: single quotes, semicolons, trailing commas, printWidth 100.
- Match existing patterns (colocated hooks, named exports, locale keys) over inventing new ones.
